# Keep every checkout byte-identical across platforms.
#
# Git converts line endings on Windows by default, and several things here
# compare bytes rather than lines: the NIR golden files are matched with a plain
# string comparison, and the .vyql corpus is parsed and fingerprinted for the
# scan cache. A CRLF rewrite at checkout makes all ten golden tests fail on
# Windows and nowhere else, which is a confusing way to learn about it.
* -text
